mpanies"},{"text":"Mobility companies"},{"text":"Sports-product companies"},{"text":"Packaging companies"},{"text":"Hardware startups"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship progression"},{"type":"note","label":"Year 1","text":"Design studio/creative internship"},{"type":"note","label":"Year 2","text":"CAD/prototyping internship"},{"type":"note","label":"Year 3","text":"Industrial/product design internship"},{"type":"note","label":"Year 4","text":"Product development/design internship"}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certificates are secondary to the portfolio, but technical training can be useful."},{"type":"h","text":"CAD"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SolidWorks"},{"text":"Fusion"},{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"Alias"},{"text":"Creo"},{"text":"Siemens NX"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualisation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"KeyShot"},{"text":"Blender"},{"text":"V-Ray"},{"text":"Photoshop"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CNC"},{"text":"3D printing"},{"text":"Injection moulding"},{"text":"DFM/DFA"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Design research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design thinking"},{"text":"User research"},{"text":"Usability testing"},{"text":"Human factors"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Future skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Generative design"},{"text":"AI-assisted design"},{"text":"Parametric modelling"},{"text":"Computational design"},{"text":"Digital fabrication"}]}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Entry-level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design Intern"},{"text":"Industrial Design Intern"},{"text":"Product Design Intern"},{"text":"Junior Industrial Designer"},{"text":"Junior Product Designer"},{"text":"Industrial Design Associate"},{"text":"Product Design Associate"},{"text":"Design Research Assistant"},{"text":"CAD Designer"},{"text":"3D Product Visualisation Designer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mid-level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Industrial Designer"},{"text":"Product Designer"},{"text":"Senior Industrial Designer"},{"text":"Senior Product Designer"},{"text":"Product Development Designer"},{"text":"Design Researcher"},{"text":"Design Engineer liaison/Design Development Specialist"},{"text":"Product Innovation Designer"},{"text":"Experience/Product Designer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lead Industrial Designer"},{"text":"Lead Product Designer"},{"text":"Design Lead"},{"text":"Design Manager"},{"text":"Product Design Manager"},{"text":"Industrial Design Manager"},{"text":"Design Strategist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Leadership"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design Director"},{"text":"Head of Industrial Design"},{"text":"Head of Product Design"},{"text":"Design Innovation Director"},{"text":"Chief Design Officer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What Employers May Test"},{"type":"h","text":"Design challenge"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a better water bottle for people who commute daily."},{"type":"p","text":"Expected process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","User Need","Problem Definition","Concepts","Selection","Prototype","Testing"]},{"type":"h","text":"Sketching"},{"type":"p","text":"You may be asked to sketch:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product concepts"},{"text":"Multiple variations"},{"text":"Different views"},{"text":"Exploded views"},{"text":"User interaction"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Speed and clarity matter."},{"type":"h","text":"CAD"},{"type":"p","text":"Employers may test:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3D modelling"},{"text":"Surface modelling"},{"text":"Assemblies"},{"text":"Technical drawings"},{"text":"Design modifications"},{"text":"Manufacturability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturing"},{"type":"p","text":"You designed a plastic product with a complex geometry. How would you make it manufacturable?"},{"type":"p","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Injection moulding"},{"text":"Draft"},{"text":"Wall thickness"},{"text":"Parting line"},{"text":"Assembly"},{"text":"Material"},{"text":"Cost"},{"text":"Tooling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio review"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect questions such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Why did you choose this problem?"},{"text":"What did users tell you?"},{"text":"Why this form?"},{"text":"Why this material?"},{"text":"Why this manufacturing process?"},{"text":"What alternatives did you reject?"},{"text":"What changed after prototype testing?"},{"text":"How would you reduce production cost?"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A master's is not mandatory for becoming an industrial designer, but it can support specialisation and leadership."},{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Des Product Design"},{"text":"M.Des Industrial Design"},{"text":"M.Des Transportation Design"},{"text":"M.Des Furniture Design"},{"text":"M.Des Interaction Design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced specialisations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design Strategy"},{"text":"Design Management"},{"text":"User Experience"},{"text":"Design Research"},{"text":"Sustainable Design"},{"text":"Healthcare Design"},{"text":"Automotive Design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering-adjacent"},{"type":"p","text":"Designers interested in highly technical product development can also explore programmes related to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product engineering"},{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Human factors"},{"text":"Robotics"}]}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant master's programmes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Industrial Design"},{"text":"Product Design"},{"text":"Design Engineering"},{"text":"Transportation Design"},{"text":"Furniture Design"},{"text":"Healthcare Design"},{"text":"Interaction Design"},{"text":"Design Research"},{"text":"Design Management"},{"text":"Sustainable Design"},{"text":"Circular Design"},{"text":"Human Factors"},{"text":"Innovation Design"},{"text":"Computational Design"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong international portfolio is often more important for design-school admissions than simply collecting certificates."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"0–2 years"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Intern → Junior Industrial Designer"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sketching"},{"text":"CAD"},{"text":"Rendering"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Manufacturing basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2–5 years"},{"type":"h","text":"Industrial Designer → Product Designer"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Complete product ownership"},{"text":"User research"},{"text":"Design development"},{"text":"Engineering collaboration"},{"text":"Manufacturing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5–8 years"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Industrial Designer → Lead Designer"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product families"},{"text":"Design direction"},{"text":"Mentoring"},{"text":"Brand language"},{"text":"Product strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"8–12+ years"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Manager → Design Director"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design strategy"},{"text":"Team leadership"},{"text":"Business alignment"},{"text":"Innovation"},{"text":"Portfolio direction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 Career Evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"Industrial design will increasingly become a combination of human-centred design, physical computing, AI, advanced manufacturing, robotics, sustainability, and computational design."},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Industrial Designer"},{"text":"Generative Product Designer"},{"text":"Computational Industrial Designer"},{"text":"Design Technology Specialist"},{"text":"Digital Product Prototyping Specialist"},{"text":"Smart Product Designer"},{"text":"Robotics Product Designer"},{"text":"Human-Robot Interaction Designer"},{"text":"Sustainable Product Strategist"},{"text":"Circular Product Designer"},{"text":"Digital Twin Product Designer"},{"text":"Physical AI Product Designer"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI applications"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist designers with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Concept generation"},{"text":"Design variations"},{"text":"Form exploration"},{"text":"Material alternatives"},{"text":"Generative design"},{"text":"User research synthesis"},{"text":"Market analysis"},{"text":"Rapid visualisation"},{"text":"Design optimisation"},{"text":"Simulation support"},{"text":"Personalised product concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, designers will continue to provide the crucial human judgement around desirability, usability, aesthetics, context, ethics, manufacturability, and brand identity."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Design"},{"type":"flow","items":["Design Thinking","Sketching","Form Development","Visualisation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"flow","items":["3D CAD","Surface Modelling","Technical Drawing","DFM/DFA"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Materials"},{"type":"flow","items":["Plastics","Metals","Composites","Sustainable Materials"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturing"},{"type":"flow","items":["Injection Moulding","CNC","Sheet Metal","3D Printing","Prototyping"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Human-Centred Design"},{"type":"flow","items":["User Research","Ergonomics","Anthropometry","Usability Testing"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Visualisation"},{"type":"flow","items":["KeyShot","Blender","Photoshop","Product Rendering"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product Strategy","Market Research","Cost Awareness","Brand Language"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Future"},{"type":"flow","items":["AI","Generative Design","Computational Design","Digital Twins","Smart Products","Circular Design"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Des Product / Industrial Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Industrial Design Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Industrial Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Industrial Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Industrial Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Lead Industrial Designer"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Design Director / Head of Industrial Design"},{"type":"h","text":"Chief Design Officer / Design Studio Founder"},{"type":"h","text":"Best overall strategy"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Des","exceptional portfolio","sketching","CAD","prototyping","manufacturing knowledge","ergonomics","user research","real product-development internship","AI/computational design skills is the strongest route."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The portfolio should ideally contain 6–10 high-quality case studies, rather than dozens of superficial projects. Each case study should show the complete process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Research","Insights","Ideation","Sketches","Concepts","CAD","Prototype","Testing","Iteration","Final Product","Manufacturing rationale"]},{"type":"p","text":"For industrial design hiring, this process demonstrates much more than a final attractive render: it proves that the candidate can solve real product problems and take a concept toward something that could actually be manufactured and used."}]}]}